    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Given a 6-character hexadecimal color string <var>hexCode</var>, determine if it is light or dark.<br><br>Convert the color into its Red, Green, and Blue decimal components (each between <const>0</const> and <const>255</const>):<br>- <var>R</var>: characters 1-2<br>- <var>G</var>: characters 3-4<br>- <var>B</var>: characters 5-6<br><br>Calculate perceived luminance <var>L</var>:<br><var>L</var> = <const>0.299</const> * <var>R</var> + <const>0.587</const> * <var>G</var> + <const>0.114</const> * <var>B</var><br><br>If <var>L</var> &ge; <const>128</const>, output <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">LIGHT</pre>.<br>Otherwise, output <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">DARK</pre>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\">Line 1: A string <var>hexCode</var> containing 6 hexadecimal characters.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">A single line: <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">LIGHT</pre> or <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">DARK</pre>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><var>hexCode</var> has length 6.<br>Characters are uppercase <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">0</pre>-<pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">9</pre>, <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">A</pre>-<pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">F</pre>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">FFFFFF</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">LIGHT</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
